{
  "repo": "ARMOR-ANDROID-CONTROL",
  "ecosystem": "armor",
  "tagline": "The phone window on ARMOR-SERVER: alarms that follow you, cameras, radar, energy, the network and the set-up of nodes over Bluetooth.",
  "description": "ARMOR-ANDROID-CONTROL reads and orders through ARMOR-SERVER and nothing else, except Bluetooth to set up a node, GitHub for its own updates and a public weather service. The rules are covered by 342 unit tests; the app runs on a real phone against the CM5 test bench; push through Firebase and the screens for solar, electrical and alarm-panel equipment have not met real hardware.",
  "columns": [
    "WHO USES IT",
    "THIS REPOSITORY",
    "WHAT IT TALKS TO"
  ],
